<p>You now have an admin account for <%= Settings.site_name %>. <%= link_to "Set your password", edit_admin_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %> to sign in. You can add a passkey after you sign in.</p>

<p>The link expires in <%= Devise.reset_password_within.inspect %>. After that, use “Forgot your password?” on the <%= link_to "sign-in page", new_admin_session_url %> to get a new one.</p>
